<title>USA: PIA Merchandising names Werner vice chair.</title>
<headline>PIA Merchandising names Werner vice chair.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PIA Merchandising Services Inc said Thursday it named Edwin &quot;Bud&quot; Werner as vice chairman.</p>
<p>Werner, who joined PIA in 1994, had been serving as a senior vice president of PIA and president of its marketing network and market level marketing operations.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment on whom Werner replaces.</p>
<p>PIA Merchandising provides in-store merchandising and sales services on behalf of branded product manufacturers at various retailers.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
